      "text": "Logit lens vs J-lens  (why we need this)",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 25,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Logit lens vs J-lens  (why we need this)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "85jsg65kxvf1t2tala75",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 202.0,
      "y": 230.0,
      "width": 985.0,
      "height": 20.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6b7280",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1320763136,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1028439864,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The logit lens applies W_U directly to an intermediate residual - IGNORES the ~20 blocks between there and the output.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The logit lens applies W_U directly to an intermediate residual - IGNORES the ~20 blocks between there and the output.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "c58drc11ertj5pht0hl9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 202.0,
      "y": 256.0,
      "width": 911.0,
      "height": 20.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6b7280",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1603828850,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1881625506,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The J-lens linearises those blocks into ONE matrix J_l, applies it, THEN unembeds.  Concrete + interpretable.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The J-lens linearises those blocks into ONE matrix J_l, applies it, THEN unembeds.  Concrete + interpretable.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
