      "locked": false,
      "text": "Steps 1-3:  the paper defines J_l as the AVERAGE Jacobian dh_L/dh_l across prompts and positions.  ONE matrix per layer.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 9,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Steps 1-3:  the paper defines J_l as the AVERAGE Jacobian dh_L/dh_l across prompts and positions.  ONE matrix per layer.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ylurtp0lzjjeget1ghr0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 200.0,
      "y": 1990.7177033492824,
      "width": 689.0,
