      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "[x]  Caveat:  it's a linear APPROXIMATION.  Works well 'on average'; not exact in all cases",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "[x]  Caveat:  it's a linear APPROXIMATION.  Works well 'on average'; not exact in all cases",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vy8n1utoxie0rnujjq9k",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 3044.7177033492826,
      "width": 762.0,
      "height": 17.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2109688770,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 859759429,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The J-lens is a LINEARISED approximation - it drops the RMSNorm and averages the Jacobian across prompts.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The J-lens is a LINEARISED approximation - it drops the RMSNorm and averages the Jacobian across prompts.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "e4q6qdy4lmct64z7w2se",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 3068.7177033492826,
      "width": 655.0,
      "height": 17.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 863204111,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 596471621,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Works well on typical prompts near the training distribution; degrades on OOD activations.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Works well on typical prompts near the training distribution; degrades on OOD activations.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "irmuq9e5cozroouelcqs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 3092.7177033492826,
      "width": 748.0,
      "height": 17.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 551192947,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 781525719,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "For CAUSAL interventions, the downstream nonlinear computation may amplify or dampen the effect - so we",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "For CAUSAL interventions, the downstream nonlinear computation may amplify or dampen the effect - so we",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
