      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "[x]  Caveat:  the J-lens VECTOR view is a linearisation (drops RMSNorm)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "[x]  Caveat:  the J-lens VECTOR view is a linearisation (drops RMSNorm)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "f8yc8gzkdf6j76biviss",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 5656.717703349283,
      "width": 684.0,
      "height": 17.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 494270722,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1156581144,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The RMSNorm caveat:  interventions like steering are NOT exactly linear in the logit response.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The RMSNorm caveat:  interventions like steering are NOT exactly linear in the logit response.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cqoroi5j8yit2kodwh8n",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 5680.717703349283,
      "width": 669.0,
      "height": 17.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 722363390,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1052960555,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The paper's math simplification drops the norm; adding a * v shifts logits nonlinearly in a.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The paper's math simplification drops the norm; adding a * v shifts logits nonlinearly in a.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "tp6qaq3k8a7rv4nmwvsb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 5704.717703349283,
      "width": 734.0,
      "height": 17.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 300369495,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1291231896,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Empirically it still works cleanly (\u00a76 steering: P(Paris) 0.0002 -> 0.9994), but predictions from the",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Empirically it still works cleanly (\u00a76 steering: P(Paris) 0.0002 -> 0.9994), but predictions from the",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "dz3095hs258w9zjxlh8l",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 5728.717703349283,
      "width": 712.0,
      "height": 17.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 574347711,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 8794015,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "linearised formula are only approximate.  The library's `lens.apply` includes the RMSNorm; our own",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "linearised formula are only approximate.  The library's `lens.apply` includes the RMSNorm; our own",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vaaguzroc5xt63qe8nvn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 5752.717703349283,
      "width": 691.0,
      "height": 17.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 36212488,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 535856717,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "interventions use the norm-dropped formula.  In practice this doesn't matter for the semantics.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "interventions use the norm-dropped formula.  In practice this doesn't matter for the semantics.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
