      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "d_model/dim_batch = 320 passes",
      "fontSize": 9,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 8,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "d_model/dim_batch = 320 passes",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "jh4z8d2vfhzpqvjldnhm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 220.0,
      "y": 6406.717703349283,
      "width": 912.0,
      "height": 16.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#111827",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 276021444,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1930172861,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Per prompt:  ONE forward pass (retains autograd graph) + ceil(d_model / dim_batch) backward passes on the retained graph.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Per prompt:  ONE forward pass (retains autograd graph) + ceil(d_model / dim_batch) backward passes on the retained graph.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gbsvk3x8mbgl2mcxn2el",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 220.0,
      "y": 6426.717703349283,
      "width": 785.0,
      "height": 16.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#111827",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 46819542,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1412483268,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "For Qwen 3.5 4B (d=2560, dim_batch=8):  1 forward + 320 backwards = ~3 minutes per prompt on a good GPU.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "For Qwen 3.5 4B (d=2560, dim_batch=8):  1 forward + 320 backwards = ~3 minutes per prompt on a good GPU.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "hulickhhuz83yuxyp3hb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 220.0,
      "y": 6450.717703349283,
      "width": 793.0,
      "height": 16.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#111827",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2121431503,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2141689609,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Averaged over ~1000 prompts:  J_l = mean of per-prompt J_l's.  That's the released lens (n_prompts=1000).",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Averaged over ~1000 prompts:  J_l = mean of per-prompt J_l's.  That's the released lens (n_prompts=1000).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
