      "text": "Pattern:  every intervention that uses a SINGLE J-lens vector (steer, ablate) works cleanly.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Pattern:  every intervention that uses a SINGLE J-lens vector (steer, ablate) works cleanly.",
